			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"杜拉夫"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 4530101,
					"content": "唉，真是淒慘啊。站都站不起來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜拉夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530102,
					"content": "什麼？！真是太可惡了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530103,
					"content": "可是……他沒有受傷啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530104,
					"content": "沒錯，太淒慘了。他被嚇得站不起來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜拉夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530105,
					"content": "哦……那，那真是太淒慘了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530106,
					"content": "剛才還有沒有目擊到什麼有用的情報？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530107,
					"content": "這，這還是我第一次見到狼，真是太嚇人了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "神奇的霍普金斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530108,
					"content": "…看來是沒有什麼有用的目擊情報了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530109,
					"content": "還是再去調查一下現場的痕跡吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 45305,
			"completionStepIds": [
				45305
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"45305",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 45305,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"安柏"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 4530501,
					"content": "這是狼的毛髮。據說璃月人會拿這個製作毛筆。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530502,
					"content": "毛色和書上說的蒙德狼毛色出入很大。說不定真的是外來的狼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530503,
					"content": "狼身上有好幾種毛髮，顏色深淺都不同啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530504,
					"content": "#不過，{F#妳}{M#你}看看這個——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530505,
					"content": "這是另一撮毛，不過，上面沾了什麼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530506,
						4530507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530506,
					"content": "是種子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530508
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 4530508,
					"content": "哼哼，這是鉤鉤果的種子。看到了嗎，種子上的這種鉤子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530509,
					"content": "蒙德境內，它只在奔狼領和明冠峽這種野地方才長。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530510,
					"content": "那…果然還是奔狼領的狼群囉？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530511,
					"content": "嗯…同一地區，也可能會有多個狼群爭奪領地的情況。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530512,
					"content": "雖然不知道詳情，但這也是個重要的線索，足夠推進調查了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530513,
					"content": "在出發之前，我去安撫一下村民的情緒吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "安柏"
				},
				{
					"id": 4530507,
					"content": "有什麼特殊的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4530508
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 45306,
			"completionStepIds": [
				45306
